    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d522">

                <pb facs="0586" n="570" sameAs="frus:frus1947v08/pg570"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.51/3–2247: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Wiley</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                        <lb/>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">us urgent</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1947-03-22T15:00:00-05:00">March 22, 1947—3
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>161. Confidential for Braden. Rogers<anchor n="17" xml:id="d522-f1"/> here on
                    unpublicized exploratory mission on behalf of Council to study possibilities of
                    debt settlement. President Ospina<anchor n="18" xml:id="d522-f2"/> professes
                    great interest in seeing matter cleared up but considerable difficulty may be
                    foreseen. While Rogers’ mission here is his responsibility I propose to
                    facilitate his task in every discreet way, particularly in establishing his
                    contacts and giving strong moral support.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . .</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wiley</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d522-f1" n="17" xml:id="d522-f1-content">
                <p>James Grafton Rogers, President of the Foreign Bondholders Protective
                    Council.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d522-f2" n="18" xml:id="d522-f2-content">
                <p>Mariano Ospina Pérez.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
